                        "SELECT COUNT(*) FROM gate_occupancy WHERE gate_code = 'GATE-A'", Integer.class))
                        .isZero();
            }
        } finally {
            pool.shutdownNow();
        }

        assertThat(completedWins.get() + timeoutWins.get()).isEqualTo(rounds);
